  "description": "Watch + dev-server plugin for NuStreamDocs. Wraps DocBuilder.BuildAsync in a long-running watch loop: rebuilds on file change (FileSystemWatcher with debouncing) and serves the output directory over Kestrel with a LiveReload websocket so connected browsers refresh automatically. AOT-compatible — uses WebApplication.CreateSlimBuilder + middleware routing, no reflection-based DI.",
